rows.jobDuty:
深入理解业务流程和用户需求，负责系统需求的收集、分析、整理和优先级管理；
识别重复性高、人工投入大或易出错的工作，推动流程系统化、自动化和批量化；
梳理业务流程，输出需求文档、流程图、功能说明和验收标准；
协同产品、技术、数据及业务团队，跟进需求评审、开发、测试和上线；
组织UAT、试点、培训和推广，跟踪系统使用情况及上线效果；
基于用户反馈和数据分析，持续推动系统和流程优化。
Understand business processes and user needs, and manage the collection, analysis and prioritization of system requirements;
Identify repetitive, labor-intensive or error-prone activities and drive systemization, automation and batch processing;
Map business processes and prepare requirement documents, process flows, functional specifications and acceptance criteria;
Work with Product, Engineering, Data and business teams to manage requirement reviews, development, testing and launches;
Organize UAT, pilots, training and rollout, and track system adoption and post-launch impact;
Use user feedback and data insights to continuously improve systems and processes.

rows.jobRequirement:
具备3年以上的产品运营、流程优化、业务分析、系统运营或项目管理经验；
能够独立完成需求分析，并将业务问题转化为清晰、可落地的系统方案；
具备较强的结构化思考、跨团队沟通和项目推动能力；
具备数据意识，能够发现问题并评估优化效果；
中文和英语流利，可作为工作语言，能够完成跨团队沟通和文档撰写。
3 years experience in product operations, process improvement, business analysis, system operations or project management;
Ability to independently analyze requirements and translate business problems into clear and practical system solutions;
Strong structured thinking, cross-functional communication and project execution skills;
Data-driven mindset with the ability to identify issues and evaluate improvement results;
Fluent in Chinese and English, with both languages usable for daily communication and documentation.

rows.highLight:
参与多市场业务协作，了解不同业务模式和运营场景；
参与核心业务系统和流程从0到1的建设；
推动业务流程自助化、系统化和规模化；
与产品、技术、数据及业务团队协作，解决实际业务问题。
Collaborate with teams across multiple markets and gain exposure to diverse business models;
Participate in building core business systems and processes from 0 to 1;
Drive self-service, systemization and scalability across business processes;
Work closely with Product, Engineering, Data and business teams to solve real operational problems.

